OFFICIAL PATENT SPECIFICATION: V15.2-ULTIMATE-TITAN\
TITLE OF THE INVENTION: Deterministic Dual-Channel Hybrid Control Architecture and Method for Managing Mechanical Resonance, Thermodynamic Lifecycle, and Fault-Tolerant Torque in Global Lifecycle Management.\
CLASSIFICATION: G05B 9/03 (Redundant Control Systems), F02D 41/22 (ECU Fault Diagnosis), B60W 50/00 (General Architecture for Vehicle Control).\
I. BACKGROUND AND TECHNICAL PROBLEM TO BE SOLVED\
Current Engine Control Units (ECUs) suffer from a critical gap between pure digital signal processing and the physical durability of the engine. The specific technical problems solved by this invention are:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Mechanical Resonance Excitation: Conventional systems fail to account for the elastic natural frequencies of the drivetrain, leading to premature fatigue of axles, clutches, and transmissions during rapid torque transitions.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Lack of Determinism: Modern complex algorithms introduce jitter in execution time, degrading fuel injection precision at the microsecond level.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Non-Linear Thermodynamic Stress: Binary safety limits (e.g., hard power cuts upon exceeding temperature thresholds) cause mechanical shocks and oscillations that significantly shorten engine life.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Fault-Tolerance Constraints: Standard diagnostics often react too late or too sensitively, causing either mechanical failure or unnecessary and dangerous emergency stops.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 II. DETAILED TECHNICAL DESCRIPTION OF THE INVENTION\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Dual-Channel ASIL-D/B Hybrid Supervisor (The Dual-Path Sentinel)\uc0\u8232 The invention implements a 2oo2 (Two-out-of-Two) architecture integrated into a single deterministic calculation cycle.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Path A (Estimated State): The system performs dynamic state estimation using a recursive Kalman filter. The inventive step involves the use of the KALMAN_MIN_P = 50 lower bound, which prevents the covariance matrix from corrupting (wind-up) over a billion-kilometer lifecycle. This path generates an optimized torque request (tq_a).\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Path B (Direct State): The system simultaneously reads raw sensor data and calculates a reference torque (tq_b) without filtering.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Safety Voting: An ASIL-D compliant supervisor software compares these two paths every millisecond. If SafeAbs(tq_a - tq_b) > 25 (VOTING_MARGIN), the system increments a fault counter. At 30 milliseconds, the system locks torque into a fail-safe state, protecting passengers from unintended acceleration.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Proactive Drivetrain Resonance Dampening Module (Anti-Jerk Logic)\uc0\u8232 The invention includes a mathematical model of the vehicle's drivetrain natural frequency (typically 12 Hz).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The software maintains a m_resonance_buffer state, which calculates the torque rate of change (dt/dt).\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The advanced inventive feature is the transmission integration (tcu_event). When the gearbox signals a shifting event, the code proactively doubles the damping coefficient (SMOOTHING_GAIN) to level the torque wave before it reaches the mechanical resonance point.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Continuous Thermodynamic Lerp-Fading (Thermodynamic Bridge)\uc0\u8232 Engine protection is not based on hard thresholds but on continuous state interpolation.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The invention defines a Fading Range between 40C and 70C. Within this range, the software calculates a linear coefficient (t_factor).\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
All critical parameters, including injection lead (pmax_timing) and the slew-rate limit (max_rise), are adjusted steplessly using this coefficient. This prevents micro-fractures caused by sudden thermal expansion of engine metals.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Barometric Turbocharger Protection (Altitude Safety Matrix)\uc0\u8232 The invention accounts for the effect of air pressure (baro_raw) on turbocharger hydromechanics.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The software calculates a dynamic baro_factor that scales maximum torque downward as air thins.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
This prevents the turbocharger shaft from reaching critical overspeed, which is the most common cause of engine failure at high altitudes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 III. INDEPENDENT CLAIMS (THE MASTER CLAIMS)\
Claim 1: System Claim\
A deterministic engine control system comprising a memory medium and at least one multi-core processor, characterized in that the system performs in parallel:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A first torque calculation based on a recursive Kalman prediction;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A second torque calculation based on raw sensor data;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Compares said calculations in an ASIL-D safety kernel programmed to cut power if the deviation exceeds a VOTING_MARGIN;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Executes the entire calculation cycle in a deterministic 8.3-microsecond window using exclusively fixed-point arithmetic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Claim 2: Method Claim\
A computer-implemented method for preventing drivetrain resonance and wear, characterized by:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Identifying the natural frequency of the vehicle's drivetrain;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Modulating the torque request with a digital buffer that filters out said natural frequency;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Receiving a status signal from the transmission (tcu_event) and adjusting the damping intensity proactively before the mechanical torque rise;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Limiting the torque slew rate linearly relative to engine temperature between 40C and 70C.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Claim 3: Program Product Claim\
A computer-readable storage medium containing software code for executing Claims 1 and 2, specifically characterized in that the code includes:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A recursive filter with anti-windup logic (KALMAN_MIN_P);\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
An integrated barometric safety factor to prevent turbocharger overspeed;\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A dynamic watchdog token (wdt_token) modulated by a cycle counter rated at minimum 64-bit to ensure a billion-kilometer lifecycle.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 IV. MASTER LOGIC FLOWCHART\
The patent covers the following logic chain executed at every 1 ms wake-up:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Integrity Verification: Validation of STACK_MAGIC and MapIntegrity.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Signal Capture: Fetching thr_raw and rpm_raw from the ADC buffer.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Recursive Filtering: Update of Kalman prediction (Path A).\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Redundancy Comparison: Path A vs Path B (Safety Voting).\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Context Analysis: Temperature Lerp-fading and Baro-scaling.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Mechanical Shaping: Anti-Jerk buffering and slew-rate limiting.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Decision Making: Formation of final rail_dac and injector_us values.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Logging and Output: Update of wdt_token and DAC transmission.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 V. INVENTIVE STEP AND INDUSTRIAL APPLICABILITY\
This invention is not merely a way to control an engine; it is a mechanical insurance policy. It distinguishes itself from the prior art by the way it integrates mathematical state filtering (Kalman), functional safety standards (ASIL-D), and mechanical resonance management into a single, cohesive, and deterministic process. It enables the construction of lighter and more efficient engines because the software guarantees that mechanical stress limits are never exceeded, even in highly dynamic situations.\
